            {
              "text": "Nah 1.1—3.19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEP.2.13+ZEP.2.14+ZEP.2.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Sef 2.13-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan jed'e, Anini worra Ashuru boku tolfad'e nama anini iti dallaneeni d'aana! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini gosa Waaqa imbeenne ta na dallansiftuti erga, aka worra hatani saamani akuma huura kara keesati ira ejaanjatani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo hayyichi Ashuru mala ufii ka woini yakuu qaba, inni aka gosa d'ibi balleesu ya kutate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni kiyyibe waan jed'u, Jari askarti tiyya gugurdaani ch'ufti hayyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini dira Kalnotifi ka Karkemishitifi ka Hamathitifi ka Arpaditifi ka Samariatifi ka Damaskile had'e dabsad'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini harka kiyya d'eerefad'e, lafa waan harkaani boch'ani kad'atu, ta wonti kad'atani sunini ta Yerusalemutifi ta Samariale ira heddu, gaargalchuu fed'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini Samariafi waan harkaani boch'ani kad'atanile ya balleese, Yerusalemufi waan boch'ani ka achiti kad'atanile akasuma tolcha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u, gaafa anini huji tiyya gaara Sioni gubbafi Yerusalemu keesale hobaasu, anini hayyu Ashuru ingaargalcha, waan inni akasi kiyyibe ufi olfuud'eefi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyichi Ashuru kiyyibe waan jed'u, Anini waan kana ch'ufa irruma tiyyaani tolche; anini jaba ammalle qaroo. Anini seera jiddu lafaa deeme lafa gosa gosa gargari baasu balleese, waan worri olikeyate ch'ufa boojie, aka korma looni nama achi tau ch'ufa ira ejaanjad'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gochiti lafaa mana simpirre fakaati, duuba anini waan worri qabu akuma okhokaani guurani gaargala male guura. Wonti barisa tokoleeni na insodaachimne, yokhaani wonti afaani qaba tokoleeni nati iniyyine!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u, D'agaraani, Anini nama naani hojatu ira jira ufiini injed'a? Wonti woini murani nama woini muru ira jirti? Bokuuni nama oli infuud'u, namati isa olifuud'a male.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi guddaani nama nyaachisa nyaatu, d'ukuba iti buuse gaargalcha; nafa worra ibidati keesa bobaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqi ifsaani Israeli ibida tahe, Waaqi qulqullooni Israeli bobae, guyya tokooni waan ch'ufa gube balleesa, qoraatifi mogorele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badda guddofi oobru dadansale ch'ufa balleesani, akuma d'ukubi hamani nama balleesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhi baddaa hobae tatakate, ijoolleleeni dandeete hedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nama diqaati gala",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyyaani ind'ufa, ka worri Israeli ka hafe gosa worra diquma inhobaasini taani deebie inabdanne, ammo AABBO Waaqa Israeli qulqullo abdatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Israeli, nama diqaati, Waaqa guddati deebia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rum 9.27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato amma tana worri Israeli heddu aka maansa galaanaa taatele, nama diqaati deebia. Baddi worraa malte ya hereganifi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafa ch'ufa keesa AABBO Waaqi guddaani badiini d'ufa, akuma inni duri jed'e kaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka AABBO Waaqi worra Ashuru gaargalchu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi guddaani waan nama isaa ka Sioni keesa tauni jed'u, Worra Ashuru insodaatina, ato worri aka worri Misiri duri isani gaargalche isani gaargalchele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulti diqooti, dallansuuni anini isaniti dallanu naraa galti, duuba anini worra suniti dallane balleesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini, AABBO Waaqi guddaani, licho tiyyaani worra d'aana, akuma duri worra Midiani d'akha Orebuti d'aane. Anini akuma Misiri gaargalche Ashurule gaargalcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hojja guyyaani sunini d'ufu, anini harka worra Ashuru keesaa isani baasa, qaampari worra deebie gurmu teesani ira intau.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka nyaapi wo had'u",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuli nyaapa yayu dira Ai dabsate, dira Migroni keesa dabre, miha ufii Mikmashiti olikeyate! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri yayu kaarra bahe Geba bule! Worri dira Rama ya mudame, worri dira hayyu Saulo, ka Gebia jed'ani keesa jiru ya baqate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worra Galimu iyya! Worra Laisha, ch'aqasa! Worra Anathothi jalaa qaba! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Madmenatiifi ka Gebimu baqachu jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arra nyaapi ya dira Nobu d'ufe, achiti tae, gaara Sioni ka dira Yerusalemu harka tontomate iti irbu jira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
